e\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">The first International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC) was co-hosted by the Behavioral Science Research Institute (BSRI), Srinakharinwirot University (SWU), Thailand and the Department of Psychology, International Islamic University Malaysia (IIUM) in 2004. Following this, the IPRC was co-hosted by each faculty in alternate years. For more detail of IPRC, you can visit this page: <\\/span><a style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\" href=\\"https:\\/\\/ejournals.swu.ac.th\\/index.php\\/iprc\\/about\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\">https:\\/\\/ejournals.swu.ac.th\\/index.php\\/iprc\\/about<\\/a><\\/h1>\\r\\n<\\/header>\\r\\n<div class=\\"entry-content clear\\">\\r\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes\\">\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" style=\\"width: 14%;\\" data-align=\\"left\\"><strong>Year<\\/strong><\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\"><strong>Date and Place<\\/strong><\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2004<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 1<sup>st<\\/sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2004) was held during 5<sup>th<\\/sup>-10<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;September 2004 at IIUM, Malaysia &nbsp;<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2005<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 2<sup>nd<\\/sup>&nbsp;International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2005) was held during 15<sup>th<\\/sup>-17<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;August 2005 at BSRI, Thailand &nbsp;<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2006<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 3<sup>rd<\\/sup>&nbsp;International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2006) was held in May 2006 at IIUM, Malaysia<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2007<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 4<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp; International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2007) was held in 19<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp;\\u2013 20<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp;June 2007 at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2008<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 5<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp; International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2008) was held in June 2008 at IIUM, Malaysia<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2009<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 6<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp; International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2009) was held in 17<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp;\\u2013 18<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp;June 2009 at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2010<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 7<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp; International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2010) was held in IIUM<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2011<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 8<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp; International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2011) was held in 22<sup>nd<\\/sup>&nbsp;\\u2013 23<sup>rd<\\/sup>&nbsp;September 2011 at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2012<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 9<sup>th<\\/sup>&nbsp; International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2012) was held in IIUM<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2013<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 10th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2013) was held during 26th-27th August, 2013 at BSRI, Thailand.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2014<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 11th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2014) was held from 21st to 23rd August, 2014 in Malaysia. -This IPRC was co-hosted by the Department of Food Service and Management, Faculty of Food Science and Technology, Universiti Putra Malaysia, Selangor, Malaysia, and the Department of Psychology, International Islamic University Malaysia, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2015<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 12th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium (IPRC 2015) was held from 26-27th August, 2015 at the BSRI, Thailand. &nbsp;<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2016<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 13th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium \\u2013IPRC 2016 was held on 23rd and 24th September, 2016, at IIUM Malaysia.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2017<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 14 th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium 2017 was held at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2018<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 15th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2018 was held from 3-4th October 2018 at IIUM, Malaysia<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2019<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 16th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2019 was held from 24-25th October 2019 at BSRI, Thailand.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2020<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 17th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2020 was held on 3 February 2021 at IIUM, Malaysia. This IPRC was held online for the first time, later IPRC 2021 was also held online.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2021<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 18th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2021&nbsp; was held on 29 October 2021 at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\"background-color: #d6eeee;\\">\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2022<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 19th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2022 will be held online at Universitas Mercu Buana, Jakarta &nbsp;<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2023<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 20th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2023&nbsp; was held on 17 July 2023 at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2024<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 21st International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2024&nbsp; was held on 13-14 August 2024 at IIUM, Malaysia<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">IPRC 2025<\\/td>\\r\\n<td class=\\"has-text-align-left\\" data-align=\\"left\\">The 20th International Postgraduate Research Colloquium-IPRC&nbsp; 2025&nbsp; on 23 August 2025 at BSRI, Thailand<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n<\\/figure>\\r\\n<\\/div>"},"remoteUrl":{"en":""},"title":{"en":"History of IPRC"}},"_hasLoadableAdapters":false,"_metadataExtractionAdapters":[],"_extractionAdaptersLoaded":false,"_metadataInjectionAdapters":[],"_injectionAdaptersLoaded":false,"navigationMenuItems":[],"_isDisplayed":true,"_isChildVisible":false},"children":[]},{"_data":{"id":2237,"menuId":87,"menuItemId":761,"parentId":750,"seq":3},"_hasLoadableAdapters":false,"_metadataExtractionAdapters":[],"_extractionAdaptersLoaded":false,"_metadataInjectionAdapters":[],"_injectionAdaptersLoaded":false,"navigationMenuItem":{"_data":{"id":761,"contextId":51,"type":"NMI_TYPE_CUSTOM","path":"committee","content":{"en":"<p>Under Construction<\\/p>"},"remoteUrl":{"en":""},"title":{"en":"Committee"}},"_hasLoadableAdapters":false,"_metadataExtractionAdapters":[],"_extractionAdaptersLoaded":false,"_metadataInjectionAdapters":[],"_injectionAdaptersLoaded":false,"navigationMenuItems":[],"_isDisplayed":true,"_isChildVisible":false},"children":[]},{"_data":{"id":2238,"menuId":87,"menuItemId":753,"parentId":750,"seq":4},"_hasLoadableAdapters":false,"_metadataExtractionAdapters":[],"_extractionAdaptersLoaded":false,"_metadataInjectionAdapters":[],"_injectionAdaptersLoaded":false,"navigationMenuItem":{"_data":{"id":753,"contextId":51,"type":"NMI_TYPE_EDITORIAL_TEAM","path":null,"titleLocaleKey":"about.editorialTeam"},"_hasLoadableAda