rcu Buana, Jakarta, Indonesia<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-title title fusion-title-5 fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-four\\">\\r\\n<h4 class=\\"title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated\\"><strong>Overall IPRC Has 11 Participating Universities<\\/strong><\\/h4>\\r\\n<div class=\\"title-sep-container title-sep-container-right\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"title-sep sep- sep-solid\\"><strong>In The IPRC-2023 There are 7 Participating Universities From The Previous Years Which Include:<\\/strong><\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<ul class=\\"fusion-checklist fusion-checklist-2 fusion-checklist-default type-icons\\">\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>BSRI<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<em>Behavioral Science Research Institute, Srinakharinwirot University, Thailand<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>IIUM<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<em>Department of Psychology, Kulliyyah of Islamic Revealed Knowledge &amp; Human Sciences, International Islamic University Malaysia, Malaysia<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>UMB<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<em>Faculty of Psychology, Universitas Mercu Buana, Jakarta, Indonesia<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>UII<\\/strong>, Department of Psychology, Universitas Islam Indonesia, Yogyakarta, Indonesia<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>UMB<\\/strong>,<em>&nbsp;Faculty of Psychology, Universitas Mercu Buana, Jakarta, Indonesia<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>BUU,<\\/strong><em><strong>&nbsp;<\\/strong>College of Research Methodology and Cognitive Science, Burapha University, Thailand<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>MU,<\\/strong>&nbsp;Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Mahidol University, Thailand<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<div class=\\"title-sep sep- sep-solid\\"><strong>Four New Universities Joining in 2023. BSRI has 4 New Partner Universities that are Joining The IPRC-2023.<\\/strong><\\/div>\\r\\n<ul class=\\"fusion-checklist fusion-checklist-3 fusion-checklist-default type-icons\\">\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>HCM,<\\/strong><em>&nbsp;Department of Psychology, University of Social Sciences and Humanities, Ho Chi Mihn City, Vietnam<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>YEOU,&nbsp;<\\/strong><em>Yangon University of Education, Yangon, Myanmar<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>UNJ,<\\/strong><em>&nbsp;State University of Jakarta, Indonesia<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\"fusion-li-item\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"fusion-li-item-content\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>AdMU,<\\/strong>&nbsp;<em>Ateneo de Manila University, Philiphines<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>"},"remoteUrl":{"en":""},"title":{"en":"Partner University"}},"_hasLoadableAdapters":false,"_metadataExtractionAdapters":[],"_extractionAdaptersLoaded":false,"_metadataInjectionAdapters":[],"_injectionAdaptersLoaded":false,"navigationMenuItems":[],"_isDisplayed":true,"_isChildVisible":false},"children":[]},{"_data":{"id":2240,"menuId":87,"menuItemId":754,"parentId":750,"seq":6},"_hasLoadableAda